&lt;p class="style_pb_after" style="line-height: 1; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;ｂ．指名報酬委員会の活動状況&lt;/p&gt;
